          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Hamas and the PLO</strong><br>\nRelations between the PLO and Hamas, another significant Palestinian organization, are complicated. While the PLO is more secular and politically oriented, Hamas is an Islamist and militant group. There have been attempts to form a unity government, but deep-seated ideological differences have made this difficult.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Current Situation</strong><br>\nThe current political and military situation in the region remains tense. The PLO continues to seek a two-state solution and negotiates with Israel and other international players. However, many challenges and obstacles stand in the way of a lasting and just resolution of the conflict.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Significance in Music</strong><br>\nThe conflicts and political situation in Palestine and Israel have also influenced the music scene. Many musicians and artists have drawn inspiration from the events and have used their works to raise awareness of the situation or express their solidarity with the Palestinian people.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3d655444-fd55-42f7-aba2-16a16db7dc58"
            },
